title: 'C-c v u : skg-toggle-fork-dedup-overlay'
pid: 7be8718c-810c-4959-998b-9dcb1d058bd3
body: |2-
  Toggles, in this buffer, the overlays that say what a member of a
  forks folder restates of its note: =<b unchanged>= over the title of
  a member whose title and body equal the note's, its body hidden;
  =<b's title unchanged>= over a title alone equal to the note's;
  =<b's body unchanged>= over a body alone equal to it
  (docs/forks.org, "A member that restates its note"). They are on by
  default (the buffer-local variable 'skg-fork-dedup-overlay'); turn
  them off to read or edit the text under them. The buffer always holds
  the real text, and a save sends it.
